// "Blocks" = an object is declared as a blocker ([CR#509.1g]) — the
// declare-blockers onset the "whenever ~ blocks" trigger family watches
// ([CR#509.3a]: triggers once per combat even if it blocks multiple
// creatures). Mirrors event/Attacks + event/Dies. Usage: Blocks(what) —
// e.g. Blocks(Type(Creature)), Blocks(Ref(This)).
(
    name: "Blocks",
    template: "${0} blocks",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate],
    body: BlockDeclared(by: Param(0)),
)
